### Exemplos HTTP — VS Code (REST Client), Visual Studio, Rider.
### Arrancar a API primeiro:  dotnet run --project src/Partners.Api   (http://localhost:5080)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### 1. Criar cliente (nome com espaços, NIF com pontos -> guarda "Ana Silva" / "001234567")
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/partners
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Name": " Ana Silva ",
  "TaxNumber": "001.234.567",
  "Type": "CUSTOMER",
  "Email": "ana.silva@example.com",
  "CreditLimit": 5000.50
}

###
@partnerId = {{create.response.body.$.Id}}
@version = {{create.response.body.$.Version}}

### 2. Obter por Id (também devolve inativas; 404 se não existir)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/partners/{{partnerId}}

### 3. Mesmo NIF com outra representação -> 409 duplicate_tax_number
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/partners
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Name": "Outra Ana", "TaxNumber": "001 234 567", "Type": "SUPPLIER", "Email": null, "CreditLimit": 0 }

### 4. Entidade BOTH
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/partners
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Name": "Tecnologias Ponte SA", "TaxNumber": "501-234-567", "Type": "BOTH", "Email": "", "CreditLimit": 25000 }

### 5. Listagem (por defeito: só ativas, Page=1, PageSize=20)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/partners

### 6. Filtros combinados: Search (nome ou NIF), Type, IncludeInactive, paginação
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/partners?Search=ana&Type=CUSTOMER&IncludeInactive=true&Page=1&PageSize=5

### 7. Procurar por NIF (separadores são normalizados)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/partners?Search=001.234

### 8. Página além dos resultados -> Items vazio e TotalCount correto
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/partners?Page=99

### 9. Atualizar (PUT completo; Version obrigatória) — desativar
# @name update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/partners/{{partnerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Name": "Ana Silva",
  "TaxNumber": "001234567",
  "Type": "CUSTOMER",
  "Email": null,
  "CreditLimit": 5000.50,
  "IsActive": false,
  "Version": "{{version}}"
}

### 10. Repetir o PUT com a Version antiga -> 409 version_conflict
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/partners/{{partnerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Name": "Nao Deve Gravar",
  "TaxNumber": "001234567",
  "Type": "CUSTOMER",
  "Email": null,
  "CreditLimit": 1,
  "IsActive": true,
  "Version": "{{version}}"
}

### 11. Reativar usando a nova Version
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/partners/{{partnerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Name": "Ana Silva",
  "TaxNumber": "001234567",
  "Type": "CUSTOMER",
  "Email": null,
  "CreditLimit": 5000.50,
  "IsActive": true,
  "Version": "{{update.response.body.$.Version}}"
}

### ---------- Pedidos inválidos (todos 400, sem alterações) ----------

### CreditLimit com três casas decimais
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/partners
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Name": "Ana", "TaxNumber": "123456789", "Type": "CUSTOMER", "Email": null, "CreditLimit": 10.999 }

### NIF com letras
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/partners
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Name": "Ana", "TaxNumber": "12345678A", "Type": "CUSTOMER", "Email": null, "CreditLimit": 10 }

### Page=0
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/partners?Page=0

### Type inválido
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/partners?Type=INVALID

### Version malformada
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/partners/{{partnerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Name": "Ana", "TaxNumber": "001234567", "Type": "CUSTOMER", "Email": null, "CreditLimit": 1, "IsActive": true, "Version": "isto-nao-e-base64" }
